<Base title="Privacy"><div class="wrap"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow accent">Site information</p><h1>Privacy</h1></header><article class="prose narrow"><h2>No visitor analytics</h2><p>This website does not install analytics scripts or use advertising trackers. It does not attempt to identify your employer or record your browsing history.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>When the contact form is enabled and you submit a message, your name, email address, and message are sent to Formspree to deliver to me. I use those details to respond to your inquiry. Please avoid including sensitive information. See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/">Formspree’s privacy policy</a> for its processing and retention practices.</p><h2>Hosting and external content</h2><p>GitHub Pages hosts this site and may process technical request information as described in <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>. Fonts and artwork are served with the site.</p><p>Playground sketches load from p5.js only after you choose to start them. Those requests are handled by the external provider. Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, publications, and other websites take you to services with their own privacy practices.</p></article></div></Base>
